title Home Assistant: Reconnecting: the link dropped, the next try waits (2, 4, 8 ... 60 s); the tiles greyed with their last word
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO reconnecting

wait 2600
shot reconnecting
check reconnecting
expect text "Reconnecting..."
expect text "Ceiling light"
expect noquit
